From 8c55c4bb74f7d9be60784d9b8b04496c78f15235 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
Date: Fri, 7 Aug 2026 11:25:16 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] hw/arm: bletchley: correct the file copyright header

The header carried "Copyright 2016 IBM Corp.", which does not reflect
the machine's actual history:

  - The Bletchley machine was added in 2022 by Patrick Williams
    (a20c54b1231 "hw/arm/aspeed: add Bletchley machine type") as code
    inside the shared hw/arm/aspeed.c, with no per-file copyright.
  - It was later extracted into its own source file by Jamin Lin
    (2bf16a24d61 "hw/arm/aspeed: Split Bletchley machine into a
    separate source file for maintainability"), and the new file
    header was seeded with an unrelated "2016 IBM Corp." line.

Bletchley is a Facebook board, so credit Meta Platforms for its 2022
authorship instead.

Signed-off-by: Emmanuel Blot <emmanuel.blot@free.fr>
---
 hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600_bletchley.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600_bletchley.c b/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600_bletchley.c
index 7d0b4afefb..4dd000714b 100644
--- a/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600_bletchley.c
+++ b/hw/arm/aspeed_ast2600_bletchley.c
@@ -1,7 +1,7 @@
 /*
- * Facebook Bletchley
+ * Facebook Bletchley BMC
  *
- * Copyright 2016 IBM Corp.
+ * Copyright (c) 2022 Meta Platforms, Inc. and affiliates
  *
  * SPDX-License-Identifier: GPL-2.0-or-later
  *
-- 
2.53.0-Meta

